    "why": "The VDOM runtime's onBeforeUnmount that, as the KeepAlive is unmounted, decides for each cached vnode whether it is the current child (reset shape flag + invoke deactivated hook, i.e. kept) or is unmounted outright."
  },
  {
    "path": "packages/runtime-vapor/src/components/KeepAlive.ts",
    "from_line": 287,
    "to_line": 303,
    "why": "pruneCacheEntry, which decides for a cached branch whether it is removed outright (unsetShapeFlag + remove from its live parent + scope.stop) or, if it is the current branch, merely unset its keep-alive flag and kept."
  },
  {
    "path": "packages/runtime-vapor/src/components/KeepAlive.ts",
    "from_line": 628,
    "to_line": 654,
    "why": "The deactivate() implementation that executes the keep outcome by unsetting refs, invalidating mount hooks, moving the branch into the storage container (detaching it from the live DOM), and firing its deactivated hooks."
  }
]
```

